OL,3,GNEWSAUp to 500 new homes proposed on
OL,4,Agolf course
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 500-home development could be coming
OL,7,Fto a Surrey golf course, despite it
OL,8,Ffalling within the green belt.
OL,10,FCater Properties Limited is seeking
OL,11,Fplanning permission for the project,
OL,12,Fwhich is proposed for a 21-hectare plot
OL,13,Fat Sunbury Golf Club in Shepperton,
OL,14,Faccording to the the Local Democracy
OL,15,FReporting Service.
OL,17,FIf approved, Cater Properties said the
OL,18,Fsite would be repurposed into a
OL,19,F"residential-led neighbourhood".
OL,23,APub: 17-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
