OL,3,GNEWSAUp to 500 new homes proposed on
OL,4,Agolf course
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn planning documents, the developer
OL,7,Fsaid the scheme represented a
OL,8,F"sustainable, deliverable and
OL,9,Fwell-connected opportunity" which could
OL,10,Fmake "a meaningful contribution towards
OL,11,Fhousing delivery and wider community
OL,12,Finfrastructure provision".
